 Ring! Put on your gloves, face your opponents and test your fighting skills in intense boxing matches.\n\nThrow punches, dodge incoming attacks and use your timing and reactions to gain the advantage. Every matchup challenges you to stay focused, defend yourself and find the right moment to strike.\n\n**Game Features**\n\n- **Boxing Action:** Experience exciting boxing gameplay inside the ring.\n- **Fight Opponents:** Face challenging opponents and test your fighting abilities.\n- **Punch and Defend:** Throw punches, avoid attacks and protect yourself.\n- **Test Your Skills:** Improve your timing, reactions and boxing techniques.\n- **Competitive Matches:** Take on boxing challenges and fight for victory.\n- **Immersive Ring Experience:** Step into the boxing ring and experience the action up close.\n\nAre you ready to step into the ring? Put on your gloves, prepare for the fight and show your boxing skills in Boxing Ring!", "short_description": "Step into the boxing ring and experience intense boxing action! Face your opponents, throw powerful punches, dodge incoming attacks and test your fighting skills. Master your timing, improve your boxing technique and fight your way through challenging matchups. Stay focused, defend yourself and look for the perfect opportunity to strike. Get ready to put on your gloves, enter the ring and experience the excitement of competitive boxing!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/next-bit-games/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Next_Bit", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/next-bit-games/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscrip