mprove your timing, reactions and boxing techniques.\n- **Competitive Matches:** Take on boxing challenges and fight for victory.\n- **Immersive Ring Experience:** Step into the boxing ring and experience the action up close.\n\nAre you ready to step into the ring? Put on your gloves, prepare for the fight and show your boxing skills in Boxing Ring!", "short_description": "Step into the boxing ring and experience intense boxing action! Face your opponents, throw powerful punches, dodge incoming attacks and test your fighting skills. Master your timing, improve your boxing technique and fight your way through challenging matchups. Stay focused, defend yourself and look for the perfect opportunity to strike. Get ready to put on your gloves, enter the ring and experience the excitement of competitive boxing!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/next-bit-games/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Next_Bit", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/next-bit-games/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1502989052893876"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2374542746615240"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4596767177270756"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "4596767177270756"}, "is_approved": true, "first